#: userland/apps/reliefword/window.cpp:267
msgid ""
"ReliefOS project report\n"
"A document made with ReliefWord\n"
"\n"
"Overview\n"
"Write, edit and arrange Chinese and English text on real pages. The ribbon keeps everyday commands within reach.\n"
"\n"
"This week's work\n"
"Draft the proposal and collect feedback.\n"
"Review the document together.\n"
"Save the final document in the original format.\n"
"\n"
"Next steps\n"
"Use headings, lists and paragraph spacing to make the report easy to read. You can open TXT or HTML and save an editable .rword copy.\n"
"\n"
"Prepared with ReliefWord — simple tools for everyday writing."
msgstr ""
"ReliefOS 项目报告\n"
"使用 ReliefWord 编写的工作文档\n"
"\n"
"工作概览\n"
"在真实的纸张页面中编写、编辑和排版中文与英文。常用工具集中在顶部功能区，便于随时操作。\n"
"\n"
"本周工作\n"
"整理项目方案并收集反馈。\n"
"共同审阅文档，完善重点内容。\n"
"使用原生格式保存最终版本。\n"
"\n"
"下一步计划\n"
"使用标题、列表和段落间距，让报告更清晰易读。还可以导入 TXT 或 HTML，另存为可继续编辑的 .rword 文档。\n"
"\n"
"由 ReliefWord 编写——用于日常写作的简单工具。"

